SchildiChat Revenge is a Matrix client for Desktop, and the first SchildiChat client that is not an Element fork (so expect missing features when coming from one).

<div class="note">

**NOTE**: This client is in it's early alpha stages, so expect bugs and lack of functionality.  
If you're looking for the no-longer maintained SchildiChat Desktop client based on Element Web, you can find it [here](/legacy/desktop).  

</div>

**Discussion**: [#revenge:schildi.chat](https://matrix.to/#/#revenge:schildi.chat)  
**Releases/downloads**: [GitHub]({{github_src_link}}/releases)


